  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 73ff519377b990a4c81cd1461a3c1f62, type: 3}
  m_Name: LolaBebang_W75_Teach
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueNode
  speakerName: Lola Bebang
  speakerPortrait: {fileID: 0}
  dialogueText: 'Dagiti saludsod ket makatulong kadatayo a mangammo iti lubong iti
    aglawlawtayo.


    Iti Ilokano, ti ''ania'' ket kayatna a saoen ti ''what.''


    Usarem
    daytoy no damagem maipapan iti maysa a banag, bagay, wenno impormasyon.


    Denggem
    a naimbag: ania.


    Ita, padasem nga ibagam ti ''ania'' iti bukodmo a timek.'
  translatedText: 'Questions help us learn about the world around us.

    In Ilokano,
    ''ania'' means ''what.''

    Use it when asking about an object, thing, or information.

    Now,
    try saying ''ania'' yourself.'
